'''Crank Fizzlebub''' is a [[goblin]] [[quest giver]] located in the [[Salty Sailor Tavern]] in [[Booty Bay]], in the [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. Like many goblins, he can be quite shady in his operations. He has adventurers obtain [[Singing Blue Crystal]]s from members of the [[Venture Company]] for his own gain and assists [[Kravel Koalbeard]] in fixing the rocket car races at the [[Mirage Raceway]] by using the mind-bending [[Zanzil's Mixture]] on the crew pit teams.

